	(text_box "- IEEE 802.3u 10/100 Base-T compliant Ethernet.\n- Auto-negotiation\n- Automatic polarity detection and correction\n- Wake-On-Lan support\n- Link Activity and Link Speed indicator support\n- RMII interface"
